{
  "name": "ScGeom6D",
  "category": "interactions",
  "parent": "ScGeom",
  "description": "Class representing geometry<IGeom> of two bodies<Body> in contact. The contact has 6 DOFs (normal, 2\u00d7shear, twist, 2xbending) and uses ScGeom incremental algorithm for updating shear.",
